OL,3,ARoyal Family join veterans and families
OL,4,Aat Festival of Remembrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III led senior members of
OL,7,Fthe Royal Family as they paid tribute
OL,8,Fto British service personnel at this
OL,9,Fyear's Festival of Remembrance.
OL,11,FThe Prince of Wales and Catherine,
OL,12,FPrincess of Wales, joined the King and
OL,13,FQueen Camilla at London's Royal Albert
OL,14,FHall to commemorate those who lost
OL,15,Ftheir lives in service, on the eve of
OL,16,FRemembrance Sunday.
OL,18,FThe audience stood and a fanfare played
OL,19,Fas the royals entered the concert hall
OL,20,Ffor the annual event, which was also
OL,21,Fattended by bereaved families and
OL,22,Fserving personnel.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
